cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the IR Wavenumber Calculator plugin or its teaching
  activities, please cite both the accompanying manuscript and this
  software release.
type: software
title: IR Wavenumber Calculator Plugin for PyMOL
abstract: >-
  An educational PyMOL plugin that calculates approximate IR stretching
  wavenumbers, reduced masses, and force constants using the harmonic
  oscillator model, with direct bond selection from 3D molecular
  structures and support for isotopic substitution.
